{"steam_appid":2671320,"steam_name":"Hidden Cats in Tokyo","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2671320/765506/24fa759eea589e1599f071c3c0ad00536dd0a7f4/1750818256/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1734131478","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257061176/995a9af8a6f27e49ea59cbc69e1a5c2cfb386eec/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1734131478","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/ss_17f91b892c07de10faa2ff608b7b6329396a20b5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776456815","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/ss_166d838b3616642447f89908a4cb474f119f73c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776456815","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/ss_2291ef6977150826f95772daf2aa63a8a1db8790.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776456815","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/ss_dd8bf5834c1e4c709ca08c2c869fdd4b5b1104e9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776456815","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/ss_80f3e5ff9339d8cb6985bc5e7f7d53ce1e16e6ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776456815"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/0e730ef283aef6b8dae3328c1c7e9e5f.poster.avif?t=1776456815\" width=800 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/0e730ef283aef6b8dae3328c1c7e9e5f.webm?t=1776456815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A great danger is turning Tokyo's cats into monsters! Let's vaccinate and cure them before the situation gets worse!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/73a5b1b542059818d41e8966e8e7eef0.avif?t=1776456815\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras_big/73a5b1b542059818d41e8966e8e7eef0.avif?t=1776456815 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden Cats in Tokyo is a <strong>hidden object adventure game</strong>, where you need to find all the cats in Tokyo and vaccinate them before they turn into dangerous monsters and destroy the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over <strong>1400 cats </strong>to find, and almost 1750 total hidden objects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the <strong>15 levels</strong> of the city, gather the hero cats, and solve the mystery!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/1cf4a4e57bd329a1bd96bb2092da03ee.poster.avif?t=1776456815\" width=800 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/1cf4a4e57bd329a1bd96bb2092da03ee.webm?t=1776456815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Tokyo's Landmarks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/cf9f89f99b3b217a6d94833b5216a71b.avif?t=1776456815\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras_big/cf9f89f99b3b217a6d94833b5216a71b.avif?t=1776456815 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather  Hero Cats from Tokyo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/56f9cda7e76af3ff3e3a88535193c64b.poster.avif?t=1776456815\" width=800 height=291 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2671320/extras/56f9cda7e76af3ff3e3a88535193c64b.webm?t=1776456815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect many achievements from hero cat cards, monster cats, real cats, and cat things. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble your robot and face the giant monster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive Soundtrack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 1400 cats.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almost 1750 objects in total.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color Blindness</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.3 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie"],"developers":["Nukearts Studio"],"publishers":["Nukearts Studio","Dartisans"],"release_date":"12 Dec, 2024"}